    <string name="calc_stub_full">λ in the cable</string>
    <string name="calc_stub_tip1">A λ/4 section shorted at the end acts like an open circuit – a filter/trap for that frequency.</string>
    <string name="calc_stub_tip2">Length measured connector to connector, including the connectors; check with an analyser.</string>
