    <string name="calc_mismatch_loss">Mismatch loss</string>
    <string name="calc_swr_tip1" formatted="false">SWR up to 1.5 makes no difference to range; at SWR 2 you lose about 0.5 dB (11 % of the power).</string>
    <string name="calc_swr_tip2">A measurement at the radio shows SWR “improved” by cable loss – a long, lossy cable masks a bad match.</string>
