    <string name="calc_power_tip1">Every 3 dB doubles the power; 1 S-meter unit (S) ≈ 6 dB, i.e. 4× the power.</string>
    <string name="calc_power_tip2">The licence sets the transmitter output power – ERP is useful e.g. for assessing EM field exposure.</string>
